# Sourney Music MVP

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` for full instructions.

## Non-negotiables

- Preserve the loop: Search → Download (yt-dlp) → Library (SQLite) → Play
- Keep `yt-dlp` isolated in `electron/services/YtDlpService.ts`
- UI talks only through the preload IPC API — never spawn yt-dlp from the renderer
- One download at a time; queue statuses: pending/downloading/completed/failed/cancelled
- No accounts, cloud sync, social features, or payments in the MVP
- Local user albums (create/rename/delete, add/remove library tracks) are in scope; managed in Library
- Surface errors in the UI; do not crash on missing metadata, artwork, or directories
- Do not build a release/executable unless the user explicitly asks

## When changing code

- Extend services/interfaces instead of leaking infrastructure into React components
- Keep player state in the renderer so navigation does not stop playback
- Update README if setup, yt-dlp, or storage paths change
